flowchart TD
  R["RNN: h(t) = f(h(t−1), x(t))"] --> S["Step t waits for step t−1<br/>no parallelism over tokens"]
  R --> V["Information from far back<br/>passes through every step:<br/>vanishing gradients"]
  S --> T["Transformer: every token<br/>attends to every token at once"]
  V --> T
  T --> P["All positions computed in parallel<br/>on a GPU"]
  T --> D["Any two tokens one hop apart"]
  P --> SC["Scales with compute and data"]
  D --> SC
